; One variable: the alpha-border pass on a texture with soft, partial-alpha edges. `soft-alpha-disc.png`
; is a green disc with a three-texel alpha ramp inside transparent magenta texels. Godot 4.6.3's
; importer gives each texel below alpha 20 the RGB of its nearest opaque neighbour. At scale 20
; the linear filter blends from a ramp texel into its neighbour across 20 px, so a texel the pass
; missed fringes through magenta.

